# The binary: `go build -o xugo ./engine/cmd/xugo/`. xugo2, xugo3, … are
# the later serves a session builds while agents hold live sessions on
# an earlier one.
/xugo
/xugo[0-9]*

# What `go test -c`, a profile and a coverage run leave behind.
*.test
*.prof
*.out

# The session store: `xugo --data-dir data …` keeps the lineages and the
# CNF certificates they record here, one store per clone.
/data/

# The /prove pipeline's working notes: the iteration log and the
# knowledge files a clone's own sessions write. A clone that wants them
# to keep a history tracks them by choice, with `git add -f`.
/working_state/

# Claude Code's per-machine settings.
/.claude/settings.local.json

.DS_Store
